{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23679","headline":"出使在途所骑马死改乘肩轝将归长安偶咏旅怀寄太原李相公 · 白居易","name":"出使在途所骑马死改乘肩轝将归长安偶咏旅怀寄太原李相公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"驿路崎岖泥雪寒，欲登篮轝一长叹。\n风光不见桃花骑，尘土空留杏叶鞍。\n丧乘独归殊不易，脱骖相赠岂爲难。\n幷州好马应无数，不怕旌旄试觅看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23679.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23679","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}